CD-LNX-020 [October 11, 2013]
----------

    BTIDriver

        * Stepped architecture down from i686 to i586
        * Operate local PCI, local USB, and remote RPC devices from the same driver
        * Makefiles for examples call out library files after the source
          files as required by newer versions of GCC

    BTI1553

        * Fixed RTConfig() bug. When called with the disabled flag, and then later called
          with the enabled flag, sequential monitoring was enabled for all subaddresses

    BTICARD

        * Fixed bug in SysMonClear()
        * ballard.conf can set the base card number of PCI and USB cards
        * An environment variable can set the location and filename of ballard.conf
        * Added USB multi-protocol support
        * Fixed timeout bug in SYSMON SensorRd/Wr()
        * Added an example that discovers RPC devices
        * Enhanced BTICARD example #1 to show all PCI, USB, and RPC cards
          with assigned card numbers, and their product and type string


